    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ruac Na-than kɛ Dee-bid",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial Na-than jäk kä Dee-bid cuɛ ben kä jɛ kä cuɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Tëë kɛ wutni da̱ŋ rɛw ti te wi̱c kɛl, kɛl riäŋɛ kä min dɔ̱ŋ ɛ can. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn wut in riäŋ te det ti ŋuan kɛnɛ ɣɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä wut in can thilɛ jɛ ŋɔak te ni jɛn kɛ nac dɛ̈ɛ̈l rɔmä, mi cɛ kɔk. Cuɛ jɛ nööŋ kä cukɛ jɛ rɔm kɛnɛ gaatkɛ. La mi̱thɛ kä kuändɛ, kä mäthɛ rɛy buɔ̱lɛ, kä la tɔ̱ɔ̱cɛ, baapdɛ ce̱tdɛ kɛ nyaadɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ja̱a̱l ben kä wut in riäŋ, kä /kenɛ jɛ luäŋ kɛ ɣöö bɛ dɛl näk rɛy deetkɛ kiɛ yaŋ kɛ ɣöö bɛ tha̱l ja̱a̱l tin ci ben kä jɛ, duundɛ ɣöö cuɛ wä ka̱n ni dɛl wutdä min can, ɛ jɛn cuɛ na̱k ja̱a̱lkɛ mɔ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cu Dee-bid gaak ɛlɔ̱ŋ kɛ wut ɛ mɔ. Kä cuɛ Na-than jiök i̱, “Ce̱tnikɛ ciöt Kuɔth Nhial, ɛn ramɔ ci nɔmɔ la̱t ɔ, ro̱ŋɛ nikɛ lia̱a̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bɛ dɛl ɛmɔ col nikä ŋuaan, kɛ ɣöö cɛ nɔmɔ la̱t, kɛnɛ ɣöö thilɛ jɛ ca̱r.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Na-than Dee-bid jiök i̱, “Ɛ ji̱n. Kä nɛmɛ ɛ min laar Kuoth Nhial ɛ, Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl i̱, ‘Ɣän cä ji̱ kuany ala kuäär, kä cä ji̱ kän kä Thɔɔl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän cä ji̱ ka̱m kuäärɛ, kɛnɛ mänkɛ. Kä cä ji̱ jak kä kuäär kä I-thɛ-rɛl kɛnɛ Juda. Mi kuiyɛ ɛn nɛmɛ, dëë ji̱ rep kɛ rɛw ti kɔ̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuɛ la ŋu ci ruacdä lo̱k ɔ, curi ku lɛ wä la̱t ni mi jiäk ɔ? Ci U-ri-yaa raan Ɣɛ̈th näk ko̱o̱r, kä ci ciekdɛ ka̱n ala ciekdu. Ciɛ jak kä na̱kɛ ɛ ji̱ Am-on. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱c ɛ mɔ täämɛ bi raan a li̱w ko̱o̱r kä kuayku kɛ ɣöö /keni ɣä luɔ̱th, kɛnɛ ɣöö ci ciek U-ri-yaa raan Ɣɛ̈th ka̱n ala ciekdu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ci Kuoth Nhial wee i̱, ‘Nɛnɛ, ɣän bä mi jiääk jak kä tuɔ̱k ni dhɔru pa̱ny. Kä ba mänku ka̱n ni waaŋdu, kä bäkɛ ka̱m gua̱n thieekädu, kä bɛ tɔ̱ɔ̱c kɛ kɛ waaŋ nɛɛni diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ci duer la̱t kɛ tɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈. Duundɛ ɣöö bä nɛmɛ la̱t nhiam ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal, kɛ cäŋ däär.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid Na-than jiök i̱, “Ɣän cä Kuoth Nhial dui̱rikä.” Kä cu Na-than ɛ jiök i̱, “Ci Kuoth Nhial dueru woc bä, /ci bi li̱w. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ciɛ jɛn bä. Kɛ ɣöö ci mi jiääk",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12:14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "jiääk.",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mi jiääk kɛ thok Ɣi-bɛ-ru lotdɛ ni ji̱ tɛ̈r Kuɔth Nhial.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " lät kä Kuoth Nhial, bi gat in ci di̱eth li̱w.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Na-than loc dhɔrɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lia̱a̱ gatdä Dee-bid",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial gat in ci ciek U-ri-yaa ɛ da̱p Dee-bid moc juey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid Kuoth pal kɛ kui̱ gatdä. Kä cuɛ mi̱eth lo̱k, kä cuɛ wä duëëlɛ cuɛ tɔ̱ɔ̱c piny kɛ wäär kɛɛliw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ kɔarɛ diaal ben kuthdɛ, ba jɛ ben jiɛc piny. Duundɛ ɣöö cuɛ lo̱k kä /kenɛ mi̱th kɛɛl kɛ kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ bärɔw ni̱ni cu gat li̱w. Kä cu ja̱a̱ŋkɛ dual kɛ ɣöö ba la̱r lia̱a̱ gatdä. Kɛ ɣöö laar kɛnɛ i̱, “Nɛ̈n ɛ jɛ, mëë ŋot gat kɛ tëk canɛ ruac kɛ jɛ, kä /kenɛ kɔn liŋ. Banɛ jɛ ku lɛ la̱r lia̱a̱ gatdä i̱di? Dɔ̱ŋ derɛ rɔ lät kä mi jiäk.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Dee-bid ja̱a̱ŋkɛ nɛn ruackɛ kä rɔ, cuɛ jɛ diw i̱ ci gat li̱w. Kä cuɛ ja̱a̱ŋkɛ thiec i̱, “Ci gat li̱w?” Kä cukɛ jɛ loc i̱, “Cɛ li̱w.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ rɔ jiɛc, cuɛ rɔ wä lak, kä cuɛ rɔ yi̱r. Kä cuɛ bieynikɛ wäny. Kä cuɛ wä luaak Kuɔth, cuɛ wä pal. Kä mëë cɛ wä dhɔrɛ, cuɛ thiec kɛ mi̱eth, Kä cua jɛ moc mi̱eth cuɛ mi̱th. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ja̱a̱ŋkɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Kä ɛŋu ɛn nɛ ci la̱tdɛ? Mi wiee i̱ kä /keni mi̱th mëë ŋot gat kɛ tëk. Kä min ci gat li̱w ci rɔ jiɛc kä ci mi̱th.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wee i̱, “Mëë ŋot gat kɛ tëk, cä wiee kä /ka̱n mi̱th, kɛ ɣöö laarä jɛ i̱, ‘Ɛŋa mi ŋäcɛ dɔ̱ŋ dëë Kuoth Nhial ɣä luäk, a dɔ̱ŋ dëë gat tëk?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ cɛ li̱w. Kuɛ la ŋu dëë mi̱eth lo̱k ɔ? A dëë jɛ ku nyɔk kɛ luuc jɔk? Bä guɔ̱ɔ̱r ni jɛ, /cɛ bi ben kä ɣä.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Da̱p Thɔ-lo-mon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid ciekdɛ ni Bɛ̈th-cɛba lɔcdɛ Jak kä gɔaa, kä cukɛ tɔ̱ɔ̱c. Kä cuɛ dap kɛ dhɔl, kä cuɛ jɛ cɔl i̱ Thɔ-lo-mon, kä cu Kuoth Nhial ɛ nhɔk, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä cuɛ gök ni Na-than ja̱k. Kä cuɛ ciötdɛ cɔl i̱ Yɛ-did-yaa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12:25",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yɛ-did-yaa.",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lotdɛ ni ɣöö nhɔk kɛ jɛ Kuoth Nhial ɛ, kuɛnɛ kä 2 Tha-muɛl 12:24-25.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Kɛ ɣöö nhɔk Kuoth Nhial ɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ka̱p Dee-bid kɛ wec Rɛ̈-baa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn cu Yo-ab nyiëëny kɛ Rɛ̈-baa wec ji̱ Am-on, kä cuɛ wec kuäärä käp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yo-ab nath jäk kä Dee-bid, wee i̱, “Ɣän cä nyiëëny kɛ Rɛ̈-baa. Kä cä wec pi̱i̱ni ka̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ ku duɔth ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl mat, kä ma̱kɛ wec. Kɛ ɣöö mi cä ma̱k, dëë cɔl kɛ ciötdä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal ma̱a̱t, kä cuɛ wä kä Rɛ̈-baa, cuɛ wä nyiëëny kɛ ji̱ kɛ kä cuɛ käp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kum kua̱riɛn ka̱n wi̱i̱dɛ. Mi tekɛ ki̱lɛni dääpä ti jiɛɛn diɔ̱k wi̱cdɛ ŋuaan, kä tëë kɛ päm mi te kök mi di̱i̱t, kä cu Dee-bid jɛ la̱th wi̱i̱dɛ. Kä cuɛ pɛ̈ɛ̈c ti ŋuan nööŋ wi̱c. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ nɛy tëë te wi̱c nööŋ, cuɛ kɛ laat ŋät jiɛn, kɛnɛ ta̱th puɔ̱ri, kɛ thoriyni, kɛ jiöpni kä cuɛ kɛ jak kä ta̱thkɛ thuɔpni",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12:31",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "thuɔpni.",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ta̱th thuɔp kɛ thok Ɣi-bɛ-ru lotdɛ ni ɣöö cɛ naath waŋ.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Kä cu Dee-bid ɛ lät kä wi̱i̱ ji̱ Am-on diaal. Kä cuɛ rɔ ri̱t kɛnɛ nɛy diaal wä kɛ kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
